# Documentation-first workflow

This repository contains important documentation and history in the project folder.

## Before making major decisions, inspect

- `README.md`
- `FILE_TREE.md` for the current source layout and active vs. legacy components
- `documents/` logs if the task relates to prior work
- Relevant route/component files before proposing rewrites

## Rules

- Do not ignore existing documentation and do not assume unfinished work without checking the repo context first
- Use repo documentation as the source of truth for project state whenever available
